---
import LegalLayout from '../../layouts/LegalLayout.astro';
---

<LegalLayout title="Privacy Policy">
  <h2>1. Overview</h2>
  <p>
    Valley Realm values your privacy. This policy explains what data we collect, how we use it, and your rights. We keep it simple and transparent.
  </p>

  <h2>2. Information We Collect</h2>

  <h3>Minecraft Account Data</h3>
  <p>
    When you join the server, we automatically collect your Minecraft username and UUID. This is standard for any Minecraft server and is used purely for identification, moderation, and permission management.
  </p>

  <h3>Discord</h3>
  <p>
    Our Discord server is moderated by Discord's own policies. We do not collect or store Discord user data beyond what is visible in the server (display name, messages in public channels). If you interact with Discord bots we run, those interactions may be logged for functionality purposes only.
  </p>

  <h3>Website</h3>
  <p>
    This website does not set any first-party cookies. Any cookies you encounter are set by third-party services we use:
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>GitHub Pages</strong> (hosting) — may set cookies for analytics and delivery.</li>
    <li><strong>Google Fonts</strong> (typography) — may set cookies for font delivery.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    We do not run any analytics, tracking, or advertising scripts on this website.
  </p>

  <h2>3. How We Use Your Information</h2>
  <p>
    The data we collect is used solely to:
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li>Identify you on the Minecraft server.</li>
    <li>Enforce server rules and handle moderation.</li>
    <li>Manage permissions and roles (e.g., trusted player, VIP).</li>
    <li>Communicate with you on Discord when necessary.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    We do not sell, trade, or share your personal information with third parties for marketing purposes.
  </p>

  <h2>4. Data Retention</h2>
  <p>
    We retain server data (usernames, UUIDs, and associated data like inventory and builds) only as long as your account is active. If you are banned or choose to leave, your data may be retained for moderation records or until a periodic cleanup.
  </p>

  <h2>5. Your Rights</h2>
  <p>
    You have the right to:
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Request access</strong> to any personal data we hold about you.</li>
    <li><strong>Request deletion</strong> of your data (note: this may not include data required for moderation records).</li>
    <li><strong>Opt out</strong> of any non-essential data collection at any time.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    To exercise these rights, contact us on <a href="https://discord.valleyrealm.qd.je">Discord</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>6. Children's Privacy</h2>
  <p>
    We do not knowingly collect personal information from children under 13. If you are a parent or guardian and believe your child has provided personal information to us, please contact us and we will promptly remove it.
  </p>

  <h2>7. Changes to This Policy</h2>
  <p>
    We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Changes will be posted on this page with an updated date. Significant changes will be communicated through the server or Discord.
  </p>

  <h2>8. Contact</h2>
  <p>
    If you have any questions about this policy or your data, reach out to us on our <a href="https://discord.valleyrealm.qd.je">Discord server</a>.
  </p>
</LegalLayout>
